('11111111-1111-1111-1111-200000000029', '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111', 'Release QA', 'Global', 'Functionality', 'Production build passes zero critical console errors on load', 'Verify the production build produces no uncaught console errors across primary templates.', 'Zero critical (uncaught) console errors on Landing, Explore, Profile, and Upload pages.', 'Smoke Test', 'Automated', 'Critical', 'Passed', '', true, now() - interval '2 days'),
